# Environment Variables for JADU TONA Trading Academy
#
# This application is fully local-first and static.
# No environment variables are required at runtime.
# No secrets, API keys, or credentials are used.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local if your hosting platform requires it,
# but leave all values empty.

# Public application URL (optional, for sitemap/canonical if needed)
APP_BASE_URL=

# No database, auth, or observability variables needed.
# The app uses localStorage only and makes zero network calls.